      "properties": {
        "text": "## FL H3 Motion Refine\n\nKeep the baseline sampler outside the refinement node so it can be cached. Start with target_long_side = 0, strength = 0.50 and balanced motion. Set a larger target long side to upscale; use coverage off for a spatial-only comparison.\n\nThe source prompt here contains hard cuts. For a cleaner motion benchmark, also test a single continuous shot. This node does not detect or split cuts.\n\nRequires current ComfyUI, ComfyUI-MAINodes and ComfyUI-KJNodes (the example's optional attention patches). Select your local model files and upload your own reference image."
      },
